post-it: Mouse glitches
symptoms:
	Slow to boot
		shows: Windows boots slower than a healthy computer
	Mouse pointer jumps
		shows: the mouse skips when moved
	Folders open slowly
		shows: a folder takes about 2 seconds to open
software steps:
	Go to settings
	Start defrag
	Wait one day
	OK defrag result
